&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ready to make an impact? Join us and let&#39;s build the future together.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Abacus is scaling fast – more Data Solutions applications, more agent-assisted engineering, more complexity worth getting right. We’re creating this role to put a strong technical voice at the center of that growth: someone who can take sharp architectural judgment and turn it into standards the whole organization can build on with confidence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We’re looking for an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Software Architect&lt;/strong&gt; to help set the technical vision for how Abacus builds, secures, and scales its healthcare data platform &amp;amp; data applications platform. This is an individual-contributor role, not a management track – you’ll be the architecture guru and evangelist for our platform, translating business and customer needs into target-state architectures across data, applications, cloud, and agent-assisted engineering, and sharing your expertise with engineers and Solution Architects as you go.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re excited to meet architects at a range of career stages.&lt;/strong&gt; Whether you’re a mid-level seasoned architect ready to step into broader scope, a senior architect with a track record of leading complex designs, or a principal-level leader who has shaped architecture across an organization, we’d love to hear from you. We’ll meet you where you are and shape the scope of the role to the level where you can make the biggest impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our platform is built for health plans, and we’re especially excited to hear from architects who’ve worked with healthcare data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You’ll build the reusable application foundation – application blueprints, integration contracts, and production-readiness gates – that lets Data Solutions applications move fast without reinventing the wheel every time, create re-usable assets. And as agent-driven development becomes a bigger part of how we ship, you’ll be the one turning architecture standards into skills, rules, templates, and evaluation rubrics that let AI-assisted output meet the same bar as our best human-written code – putting you at the center of how Abacus builds software for years to come.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You’ll bring enough depth to guide decisions across data, application, integration, cloud, and agentic development, while staying pragmatic about fit-for-purpose architecture and delivery constraints. You won’t do it alone – you’ll partner closely with Product Engineering, our Principal Engineers, AI Engineering, Security, and Client Solutions, bringing architecture to life from concept through production, not just on a whiteboard.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your day to day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The scope of your work will scale with your level. Mid-level architects will contribute to and own defined areas of this work, while senior and principal architects will lead it across teams and the platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core architecture leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Own or contribute to the reference architecture for Abacus’s core platform – data ingestion, transformation, distribution, and serving – partnering with Principal Engineering where ingestion and distribution ownership is shared, and with Product Engineering on application and service layers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Define and apply architecture standards for scaling, high availability/disaster recovery design, serverless patterns, and multi-tenant SaaS architecture across our AWS and Azure environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Design with HITRUST and GovRamp compliance in mind, partnering with Security and Compliance so designs meet audit and control expectations from the outset rather than as an afterthought.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data applications and platform architecture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Design scalable architectures for data solutions and their analytical and operational serving layers – in our world, spanning payer claims, membership, provider, clinical, lab, and pharmacy/Rx domains.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Apply FHIR-based interoperability patterns and healthcare data standards where relevant to product or client implementations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Establish data contracts, lineage, quality controls, metadata, and integration patterns across ingestion, transformation, and serving layers, in coordination with Data Engineering.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application architecture and standards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Define standard user-management capabilities – tenant setup, roles, permissions, and admin experiences – as reusable patterns instead of something each team reinvents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with UX/Design on front-end and design-system standards that keep our applications consistent and accessible.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agent-driven development and AI-enabled engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Translate approved architecture standards into skills, rules, templates, and evaluation rubrics that our ADD Harness and agent-assisted development workflows can consume directly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Evaluate agent-generated code and designs against architectural standards, and help build the scoring and review mechanisms that let us scale the quality of agent-produced merge requests across engineering teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with AI Engineering on semantic/context layers, agent interfaces (MCP and A2A), retrieval patterns, AI gateways, evaluation, traceability, and governed model access.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture governance, knowledge sharing, and influence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Be an active contributor to Abacus’s Architecture and Data Guilds – introducing ideas, taking them to realization, and helping drive a culture of innovation through hackathons and beyond.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Share your expertise through pairing on designs, reviews, and pilots – and, as you grow in the role, mentor engineers and Solution Architects, building architectural capability across the team rather than concentrating it in one person.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Help establish lightweight architecture review mechanisms that protect critical standards without slowing delivery, measuring adoption through signals like reuse, exception volume, and escaped design defects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production readiness and operability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ensure every architecture package includes deployment topology, support model, rollback strategy, and operational telemetry, partnering with DevOps/Platform and Security on CI/CD, infrastructure as code, and observability. Help to establish quality metrics like DORA.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Hold your designs to a resiliency bar appropriate for a platform of Abacus’s scale, and help teams reason through trade-offs between delivery speed and operational risk.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you’ll have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;In your first 6–12 months, you’ll leave a clear mark on how Abacus builds software:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Deliver or contribute to a reference architecture for Data Solutions applications that teams adopt from day one – a shared blueprint, API/data contracts, and starter implementations that let new work move faster instead of starting from scratch.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Stand up the skills, rules, templates, and evaluation rubrics that let our ADD Harness and agent-assisted workflows produce work that meets our architectural bar – a foundation that scales with the team, not just with you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Build the architecture decision records, non-functional requirements, and operational-readiness checklists that give every release clear evidence it’s production-ready – deployment, observability, support, and rollback accounted for before go-live.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strengthen architecture capability across the team through pairing, reviews, and knowledge sharing – leaving Abacus with stronger architectural judgment than it had when you started.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring to the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Software engineering experience (typically 8+ years, with more depth expected at the senior and principal levels), including significant time in architecture roles designing and guiding complex cloud, data, integration, and application solutions from discovery through production operation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A full-stack engineering background&lt;/strong&gt; – hands-on experience across services and APIs, data, and cloud infrastructure – that gives you the credibility to guide architecture end to end.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A proven &lt;strong&gt;ability to establish standards&lt;/strong&gt; – you’ve helped define architecture patterns and guardrails and gotten teams to adopt them through influence and collaboration. At the senior and principal levels, this extends to leading adoption across teams and mentoring others.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Deep, hands-on experience with cloud platforms (AWS and/or Azure), including containers and container orchestration (Kubernetes/K8s, Amazon EKS, Azure AKS, Google GKE, OpenShift, or comparable), Git-based CI/CD, Infrastructure as Code, observability, and secure production operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Continuously identify opportunities to convert custom implementations into reusable platform capabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Drive standardization without sacrificing business agility.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Shape the long-term technical foundation while balancing immediate delivery needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong experience with a modern data platform and distributed data processing (e.g., Databricks and Spark, or Snowflake) and with modern application and service architectures (API-first services, with exposure to Python), identity and authorization, and multi-tenant SaaS patterns.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of agentic and AI-enabled engineering – LLM-enabled applications, MCP/A2A, LangGraph or comparable orchestration, AI-assisted developer tools (e.g., Cursor), Agent Driven Development and Harnesses, retrieval/context patterns, evaluation, and responsible AI controls.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent communication skills – able to align senior business and technical stakeholders, explain trade-offs, and produce clear architecture artifacts for both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Direct experience building or maintaining reference architectures or developer platforms used by multiple teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience defining architecture standards, rules, or evaluation rubrics for AI- or agent-assisted development workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field, or equivalent experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’d like to see, but not required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Healthcare data experience (a big plus):&lt;/strong&gt; familiarity with healthcare payer, provider, clinical, and claims data, and with FHIR or other healthcare data exchange standards. It’s the area where you’ll ramp fastest here, and we’ll make sure you get up to speed on the rest.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transformation experience:&lt;/strong&gt; you’ve been part of a digital transformation or cloud modernization effort – for example, moving legacy systems to cloud-native architectures or breaking apart monoliths – and can bring those lessons with you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Terraform&lt;/strong&gt; for infrastructure as code.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Front-end experience:&lt;/strong&gt; React/TypeScript and design-system or UX standards work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with HITRUST, GovRamp, or comparable compliance and control frameworks, and the ability to design for privacy, least privilege, auditability, and secure SDLC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation: &lt;/strong&gt;Compensation for this role is based on experience, skills, and location, and includes base salary plus eligibility for performance bonuses and equity grants.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get in return&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Unlimited paid time off – recharge when you need it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Work from anywhere – flexibility to fit your life&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health coverage – multiple plan options to choose from&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Equity for every employee – share in our success&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Growth-focused environment – your development matters here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment as an Equal Opportunity Employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;As a mission-led technology company helping to drive better healthcare outcomes, Abacus Insights believes that the best innovation and value we can bring to our customers comes from diverse ideas, thoughts, experiences, and perspectives. Therefore, we dedicate resources to building diverse teams and providing equal employment opportunities to all applicants. Abacus prohibits discrimination and harassment regarding race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At the heart of who we are is a commitment to continuously and intentionally building an inclusive culture—one that empowers every team member across the globe to do their best work and bring their authentic selves. We carry that same commitment into our hiring process, aiming to create an interview experience where you feel comfortable and confident showcasing your strengths. If there’s anything we can do to support that—big or small—please let us know.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;AI Use in Recruitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We use AI-powered tools throughout our recruitment process. This includes Greenhouse&#39;s Real Talent Matching Technology, which helps prioritize applications based on job-related criteria, as well as additional AI tools used to support sourcing, interview preparation, and other recruiting tasks. &lt;strong&gt;We do not remove the human element—our recruiters and hiring teams review all applications and make all decisions related to candidate progression and hiring, regardless of which tools are used to support that process.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identity and Location Verification&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;To protect the integrity of our hiring process, all interviews are conducted by live video with your camera on. Virtual or blurred backgrounds and headsets are not permitted absent an approved accommodation, and you should be in a well-lit, private space where your face and surroundings are clearly visible. Candidates who advance may also be asked to complete identity and location verification, which may include verifying your identity, work history, and confirming that you are located where your application states. Applications containing knowingly false or materially misrepresented information, including identity, location, or credentials, may be disqualified, and any offer may be rescinded if a material misrepresentation is discovered at any point in the process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;I&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;f you need an accommodation for any part of the interview process, please let your recruiter know in advance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;By applying, you acknowledge that we will collect and process your personal information for recruiting purposes in accordance with applicable data protection laws, including for the verification steps described above. Please review our&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;OWA4b048287-23b9-797d-9e94-700349584c71&quot; class=&quot;OWAAutoLink&quot; href=&quot;https://nam12.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fabacusinsights.com%2Fapplicant-privacy-policy%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Cheidi.weinstein%40abacusinsights.com%7C7d44e83a2b7f4081beae08df23b25d49%7C0819ed188d9747bb930bec1982f9aa76%7C0%7C0%7C639268921130656820%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C4000%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=d%2BoHUdDyVi5syk0k8eO7f73azMYj8kBhPCDKTMK%2Fcvo%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;e27af475-00b4-404d-99eb-63a7d6967b53&quot;&gt;Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;for more information, including your rights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Abacus Insights is transforming how data and AI work for health plans. Our mission is simple: make healthcare data usable, so the people responsible for care and cost decisions can act faster, with confidence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As the AI and Data Platform for Payer Intelligence, we help health plans break down data silos to create a single, trusted data foundation. That foundation powers better decisions—so plans can improve outcomes, reduce waste, and deliver better experiences for members and providers alike. Backed by $100M from top investors, we&#39;re tackling big challenges in an industry that&#39;s ready for change. Our platform enables GenAI use cases by delivering clean, connected, and reliable healthcare data to support automation, prioritization, and decision workflows—and it&#39;s why we are leading the way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our innovation begins with people. We are bold, curious, and collaborative—because the best ideas come from working together. We embrace the thoughtful use of AI and automation to drive innovation and efficiency, and we look for individuals who are curious and adaptable—those excited to leverage emerging technologies to enhance how we work—while keeping human insight, connection, and our clients at the center of every decision.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ready to make an impact? Join us and let&#39;s build the future together.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Solution Architecture team is looking to bring on an experienced Solution Architect to support both ongoing and new implementations.&amp;nbsp; We see significant growth in our future and would love for you to be a part of it! You will partner with customers and numerous internal teams to craft highly scalable, flexible and resilient cloud architectures that provide solutions to solve customer business problems and accelerate the adoption of Abacus’ offerings. As a solutions architect, you will demonstrate best practices around advanced cloud solutions and healthcare payer systems including claims processing (i.e., Medical, Vision, Prescription claims), clinical informatics (e.g., Lab Results), provider systems such as EHR, and CMS Interoperability mandate solutions.&amp;nbsp; As a trusted customer advocate, you will have the opportunity to guide a client’s successful adoption of Abacus’ core data management offerings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your day to day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Author the project architecture design documents, including data flows, sequence diagrams and overall system architecture, that will drive the technical implementation of the solutions. This role will primarily focus on defining solutions associated with CMS Interoperability, but may also work on other data solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across business and IT teams to understand the current business and system capabilities and determine the desired state to define the overall technology strategy roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with cross-functional teams, including business experts, technical business analysts, project managers, sales / account executives and data engineers to successfully implement client projects which reduce technology costs and solution redundancy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Product Management to identify client-specific requirements that may translate into an existing standard product feature or a future feature on the Abacus product roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the solution architecture visions for designated components that describe the long-term goals as well as near-term needs of the client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide mentorship to internal teams on business needs and use cases for seamless client implementation. Provide ongoing support to address questions and issues raised by the implementation team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring to the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding and passion for healthcare data and systems – including payer, provider, and integration partners. Strong working knowledge of US healthcare data, including but not limited to Medical Claims, Pharmacy Claims, Membership / Enrollment, Provider and Clinical.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Domain expertise in CMS Interoperability Mandate (9115 / 0057) - including the technology used to serve the mandated APIs as well as the data structures (FHIR) required to be compliant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to define the solution architecture vision in architecture design documents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Broad and general technical knowledge as well as competencies in infrastructure, data models, databases, service orientation, programming, frameworks, standards, and technical modeling. Strong experience with one or more cloud vendors (AWS / Azure / GCP) and data platforms (Databricks / Snowflake) desired.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of healthcare industry trends, regulations, and customer needs with preference for previous payer / Interoperability vendor experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience translating business needs into technology solutions that enable delivery of the Abacus platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communicator who can leverage their domain and technical expertise effectively with the client and build working relationships with internal and external team members. Ability to communicate succinctly and clearly, both verbally and written, across technical and non-technical audiences at multiple levels, including business leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in the payer / healthcare data space and understanding of the historical data architecture needs of our clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of client services or experience working for a cloud-based data management provider to large clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we would like to see, but not required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of Provider (EHR) Data formats and topics – including FHIR, X-12, HL-7 V2.3, and CCDA/CDA - as well as the general system architecture required to consume and make use of this data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of Utilization Management / Care Management / Disease Management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get in return&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited paid time off&amp;nbsp;– recharge when you need it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from anywhere&amp;nbsp;– flexibility to fit your life&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive health coverage&amp;nbsp;– multiple plan options to choose from&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity for every employee&amp;nbsp;– share in our success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth-focused environment&amp;nbsp;– your development matters here&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office setup allowance&amp;nbsp;– one-time support to get you started&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly cell phone allowance – stay connected with ease&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment as an Equal Opportunity Employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;As a mission-led technology company helping to drive better healthcare outcomes, Abacus Insights believes that the best innovation and value we can bring to our customers comes from diverse ideas, thoughts, experiences, and perspectives. Therefore, we dedicate resources to building diverse teams and providing equal employment opportunities to all applicants. Abacus prohibits discrimination and harassment regarding race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At the heart of who we are is a commitment to continuously and intentionally building an inclusive culture—one that empowers every team member across the globe to do their best work and bring their authentic selves. We carry that same commitment into our hiring process, aiming to create an interview experience where you feel comfortable and confident showcasing your strengths. If there’s anything we can do to support that—big or small—please let us know.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;AI Use in Recruitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We use AI-powered tools throughout our recruitment process. This includes Greenhouse&#39;s Real Talent Matching Technology, which helps prioritize applications based on job-related criteria, as well as additional AI tools used to support sourcing, interview preparation, and other recruiting tasks. &lt;strong&gt;We do not remove the human element—our recruiters and hiring teams review all applications and make all decisions related to candidate progression and hiring, regardless of which tools are used to support that process.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identity and Location Verification&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;To protect the integrity of our hiring process, all interviews are conducted by live video with your camera on. Virtual or blurred backgrounds and headsets are not permitted absent an approved accommodation, and you should be in a well-lit, private space where your face and surroundings are clearly visible. Candidates who advance may also be asked to complete identity and location verification, which may include verifying your identity, work history, and confirming that you are located where your application states. Applications containing knowingly false or materially misrepresented information, including identity, location, or credentials, may be disqualified, and any offer may be rescinded if a material misrepresentation is discovered at any point in the process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;I&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;f you need an accommodation for any part of the interview process, please let your recruiter know in advance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;By applying, you acknowledge that we will collect and process your personal information for recruiting purposes in accordance with applicable data protection laws, including for the verification steps described above. Please review our&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;OWA4b048287-23b9-797d-9e94-700349584c71&quot; class=&quot;OWAAutoLink&quot; href=&quot;https://nam12.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fabacusinsights.com%2Fapplicant-privacy-policy%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Cheidi.weinstein%40abacusinsights.com%7C7d44e83a2b7f4081beae08df23b25d49%7C0819ed188d9747bb930bec1982f9aa76%7C0%7C0%7C639268921130656820%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C4000%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=d%2BoHUdDyVi5syk0k8eO7f73azMYj8kBhPCDKTMK%2Fcvo%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;e27af475-00b4-404d-99eb-63a7d6967b53&quot;&gt;Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;for more information, including your rights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Abacus Insights is transforming how data and AI work for health plans. Our mission is simple: make healthcare data usable, so the people responsible for care and cost decisions can act faster, with confidence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As the AI and Data Platform for Payer Intelligence, we help health plans break down data silos to create a single, trusted data foundation. That foundation powers better decisions—so plans can improve outcomes, reduce waste, and deliver better experiences for members and providers alike. Backed by $100M from top investors, we&#39;re tackling big challenges in an industry that&#39;s ready for change. Our platform enables GenAI use cases by delivering clean, connected, and reliable healthcare data to support automation, prioritization, and decision workflows—and it&#39;s why we are leading the way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our innovation begins with people. We are bold, curious, and collaborative—because the best ideas come from working together. We embrace the thoughtful use of AI and automation to drive innovation and efficiency, and we look for individuals who are curious and adaptable—those excited to leverage emerging technologies to enhance how we work—while keeping human insight, connection, and our clients at the center of every decision.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ready to make an impact? Join us and let&#39;s build the future together.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Site Reliability and Forward Deployed Engineer is an individual contributor who supports production operations, incident response, and post-launch reliability across the Abacus Insights platform. Working with guidance from experienced engineers and technical leaders, this role builds practical skills in troubleshooting, automation, customer support, and reliable system operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role combines:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production operations and reliability engineering fundamentals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on technical troubleshooting during incidents and escalations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-facing technical support for deployments and production issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Software development and automation to reduce manual operational work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will help investigate production issues involving AWS infrastructure, Databricks workloads, and data pipelines. You will partner with senior engineers, platform teams, and customer-facing teams to resolve issues, improve operational documentation, and turn recurring problems into reusable solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are expected to participate actively in incident response, debug systems using established tools and runbooks, and contribute code and documentation that improve reliability and operability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role is supported through structured onboarding covering the platform, production support processes, incident response, and customer context; pairing and mentorship from experienced SRE, platform, data, and engineering team members; progressive ownership, beginning with documented and well-scoped tasks before moving to more complex incidents and customer engagements; and regular feedback focused on technical growth, operational judgment, communication, and automation skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your day to day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in production incident triage, mitigation, recovery, and follow-up activities under the guidance of experienced engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute evidence, technical findings, and follow-up actions to root cause analyses (RCAs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate and resolve well-scoped production defects and field-reported issues, escalating complex or high-risk problems appropriately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Engineering, Data, Customer Success, and Support teams during customer-impacting incidents and escalations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and improve runbooks, troubleshooting guides, monitoring, alerting, and operational checklists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support customer deployments, integrations, and production troubleshooting alongside senior or customer-facing engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and maintain Python scripts or small services that automate repeatable operational workflows, improve observability, and reduce manual toil.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use established tools and procedures to support AWS- and Databricks-based production systems, including basic performance, data quality, and job-failure investigations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document incident learnings and customer issues, and help convert recurring patterns into reusable tools, knowledge articles, and product improvement suggestions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in an on-call or shift-based support rotation after completing the required onboarding and readiness training.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring to the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2-4 years of professional experience in software engineering, site reliability engineering, technical support, production operations, data engineering, or a related field. Relevant internships, academic projects, or hands-on technical training may be considered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of cloud computing and interest in supporting production systems in AWS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic Python programming skills and the ability to read, troubleshoot, and modify existing scripts or services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Linux command-line tools, logs, APIs, or SQL-based troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of incident response, root cause analysis, monitoring, alerting, and observability concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awareness of distributed systems, CI/CD pipelines, source control, and Infrastructure as Code concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written and verbal communication, including the ability to document findings and provide timely status updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A structured troubleshooting mindset, attention to detail, and willingness to ask for help or escalate when appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to take ownership of assigned tasks through resolution with coaching and guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity, adaptability, and a strong interest in learning production reliability and customer-facing engineering practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelors Degree in engineering or related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we would like to see, but not required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internship, project, or work experience in a cloud, data, DevOps, technical support, or production operations environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to Databricks, Spark, Snowflake, data pipelines, or other data platforms and warehouses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Kubernetes or EKS, EMR, Lambda, Terraform, or similar infrastructure technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using ticketing, monitoring, logging, or incident management tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to healthcare, regulated data, or security-conscious environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience participating in an on-call, lab-support, service-desk, or operational support rotation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-facing, consulting, implementation, or technical communication experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get in return&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive Leave &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive health coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity for every employee&amp;nbsp;– share in our success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth-focused environment – your development matters here&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work arrangements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Standard hours: 9 hours/day, 5 days/week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Pune, Hybrid&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shift: Your standard working hours will be nine (9) hours per day within the Company’s standard working hours.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Specific working hours may vary based on business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
